# T0139 — Implement MFA ability (TOTP)

**Task:** T0139 (id 152) · Parent: T0111 · Project: TaskMesh (4)  
**Branch (on approval):** `T0139-mfa-totp`  
**State at plan:** Ready  

## Goal

Administrators can require TOTP MFA for **Administrators only**. Users may enroll Authenticator apps (Google / Microsoft — same RFC 6238 TOTP). Enforced users get a grace window (days) starting on **first login after policy applies**; missing the deadline **locks** the account until an Admin unlocks. Locked users see a clear message on the login screen.

